Note on student data
--------------------
This licence covers the source code only. It grants no rights over student
records, and it does not relieve any user of the obligations that apply to
personal data under Ghana's Data Protection Act, 2012 (Act 843) or equivalent
legislation. See Code6/student_performance_app/docs/DATA_PROTECTION.md.
